 "title": "An editor with its preview",
 "caption": "The page is an entry that is a page, so it is one container, with its title in its header and its actions at the start of its footer. A row of tabs at the top of its content chooses the form of the message, and one save holds every form. Under the tabs the content has a part for the details that have no preview, and then one part for each thing a person writes, under that thing's title. At a desktop the editor stands beside its own result in each part. On a tablet and a phone a person sees one of the two at a time, and a second row of tabs moves between writing and the preview: the tablet view shows the writing, and the phone view the result. Bars stand for the running text of the message.",
